/*
 * Windows resource script: gives p2500-emu.exe and p2500-gui.exe the
 * application icon that Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab read off the PE
 * image. The SDL window icon is set separately at runtime from the same
 * artwork (src/gui/icon.cpp) - a PE resource is not visible to SDL, and
 * an ELF binary has no equivalent, so both paths are needed.
 *
 * Compiled by windres only when building with MINGW=1; see the Makefile.
 * The path is relative to the project root, which the Makefile passes to
 * windres with -I.
 */
1 ICON "assets/icon/p2500icon.ico"
